  "description": "One spelling per enum member across JSON, ASP.NET Core binding, OpenAPI, EF Core and HTTP.\n      Mark enums with [StringEnum]; the bundled source generator writes AOT-safe metadata and\n      helpers (ToWireName, TryParseWire, ParseWire, IsDefined, GetNames, GetValues).\n      Includes EnumConventions, [EnumAlias], [EnumFallback], EnumValueParser, EnumValueFormatter,\n      EnumMetadata, and analyzers with code fixes (CSE0002-CSE0016).\n      Any CSharpEssentials package brings the generator and analyzers.",
